### Production Considerations
- **Privacy**: Audio data should be processed locally when possible
- **Performance**: Voice processing can be resource-intensive
- **Accuracy**: Different accents and environments affect recognition
- **Security**: Validate all voice-derived commands before execution
- **Reliability**: Fallback to text input when voice fails

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ Sending audio to external services without privacy consideration
- ❌ Not validating voice-derived commands before execution
- ❌ Blocking UI during voice processing
- ❌ Not handling poor audio quality gracefully
- ❌ Executing destructive commands from voice input without confirmation

### Quality Gates
- [ ] Voice recognition accuracy validated
- [ ] Command validation implemented
- [ ] Privacy considerations addressed
- [ ] Performance optimized for real-time use
- [ ] Error handling for poor audio quality
- [ ] Security validation for derived commands
- [ ] Fallback to text input available
- [ ] User confirmation for destructive commands